found in the original <a href="https://cdn.openai.com/gpt-5-system-card.pdf">GPT-5 system
card</a>.</p></div> </article><article id="tbl-4" class="scroll-mt-[max(6rem,calc(var(--site-nav-sticky-offset)_+_var(--system-card-banner-h,0px)_+_var(--system-card-toc-offset,0px)))] md:scroll-mt-[max(6rem,calc(var(--site-nav-sticky-offset)_+_var(--system-card-banner-h,0px)))] not-prose my-12" aria-labelledby="tbl-4-heading" data-block data-block-ref="tbl-4" data-block-section="hallucination" tabindex="-1"> <div class="not-prose mb-2xs flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2xs md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between"> <h3 id="tbl-4-heading" class="text-h4 min-w-0 font-normal text-primary-100 md:flex-1"> Table 4: Hallucination evaluation </h3> <div class="shrink-0 self-start"> <astro-island uid="Z2ra5M8" component-url="/_astro/BlockActions.BmUAId7m.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.P6ud_8Vb.js" props="{&quot;blockId&quot;:[0,&quot;tbl-4&quot;],&quot;chartId&quot;:[0,null],&quot;copyHref&quot;:[0,&quot;/gpt-5-sensitive-conversations/hallucination/tbl-4&quot;],&quot;figureHref&quot;:[0,null],&quot;figureKind&quot;:[0]}" ssr client="load" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;BlockActions&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><div class="flex items-center gap-4xs"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy permalink" title="Copy permalink" data-analytics-id="copy-permalink" class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary-12 text-primary-80 transition hover:bg-primary-4 hover:text-primary-60 focus:outline focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary-44"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3.534 6.094A.75.75 0 0 1 4.608 7.14l-.834.857-.006.007c-1.086 1.086-1.119 2.874.118 4.11 1.236 1.236 3.023 1.205 4.11.118l.008-.007.855-.834a.75.75 0 0 1 1.047 1.076l-.856.832c-1.705 1.697-4.437 1.663-6.225-.124-1.788-1.788-1.821-4.52-.124-6.225z" style="fill-opacity:1"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M9.47 5.47a.75.75 